    "intro_narrative": "The world ended decades ago, swallowed by nuclear fire and endless ash storms. You are a Scavenger, surviving in the radioactive ruins of what used to be a bustling metropolis. Rumors speak of 'Eden Vault,' a pristine underground bunker stockpiled with clean water and pre-war technology. You've finally found the heavy blast doors, but they are sealed tight by an archaic fail-safe system. The antechamber is littered with strange mechanisms, degraded tech, and cryptic logs left by the vault's paranoid architect. You must scavenge the room, reactivate the dormant machines, and decipher the override codes before your radiation suit's filters fail completely. Your survival depends on making sense of this mechanical graveyard.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
  },
